1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Now we go to Jane

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,920
who is going to tell us about what's happening in town this weekend.

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:07,980
Right, thanks Andrew, and now on to what's new

4
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:12,280
and do we really need yet another sports shop in Bradcaster?

5
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:15,200
Well, most of you probably know Sports World -

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:20,320
the branch of a Danish sports goods company that opened a few years ago

7
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,500
it's attracted a lot of custom,

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,610
and so the company has now decided to open another branch in the area.

9
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:31,620
It's going to be in the shopping centre to the west of Bradcaster

10
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,899
so that will be good news for all of you

11
00:00:33,899 --> 00:00:38,000
who've found the original shop in the north of the town hard to get to.

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,020
I was invited to a special preview

13
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:46,130
and I can promise you, this is the ultimate in sports retailing.

14
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:52,740
The whole place has been given a new minimalist look with the company's signature colours of black and red.

15
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:58,528
The first three floors have a huge range of sports clothing as well as equipment,

16
00:00:58,528 --> 00:01:03,930
and on the top floor there's a cafe and a book and DVD section.

17
00:01:03,930 --> 00:01:09,470
You'll find all the well-known names as well as some less well-known ones.

18
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:16,440
If they haven't got exactly what you want in stock they promise to get it for you in ten days.

19
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:20,430
Unlike the other store, where it can take up to fourteen days.

20
00:01:20,430 --> 00:01:25,054
They cover all the major sports, including football, tennis and swimming,

21
00:01:25,054 --> 00:01:29,180
but they particularly focus on running

22
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:33,040
and they claim to have the widest range of equipment in the country.

23
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:39,049
As well as that, a whole section of the third floor is devoted to sports bags,

24
00:01:39,049 --> 00:01:41,540
including the latest designs from the States

25
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,810
if you can't find what you want here, it doesn't exist!

26
00:01:45,810 --> 00:01:49,866
The shop will be open from 9.00 am this Saturday

27
00:01:49,866 --> 00:01:53,920
and if you go along to the opening

28
00:01:54,380 --> 00:01:58,347
then you'll have the chance to meet the national 400 metres running champion Paul King,

29
00:01:58,347 --> 00:02:01,360
who's coming along to open the shop

30
00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:06,090
and he will be staying around until about midday to chat to any fans

31
00:02:06,090 --> 00:02:09,040
who want to meet him and sign autographs.

32
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:14,020
Then there will be a whole range of special attractions all weekend.

33
00:02:14,020 --> 00:02:19,862
There will be free tickets for local sporting events for the first 50 customers,

34
00:02:19,862 --> 00:02:23,200
and also a special competition open to all.

35
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:31,800
Just answer fifteen out of twenty sports questions correctly to win a signed copy of Paul King's DVD 'Spring Tips',

36
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:39,970
while the first person to get all the questions correct gets a year's free membership of the Bradcaster Gym.

37
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:47,890
All entrants will receive a special Sports calendar with details of all Bradcaster fixtures in the coming year.

38
00:02:47,890 --> 00:02:54,829
One of the special opening offers is a fitness test-a complete review of your cardiac fitness

39
00:02:54,829 --> 00:02:59,600
and muscle tone, actually done in the shop by qualified staff.

40
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:06,100
This would normally cost 30.00 but is available at half price for this month only.

41
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:10,260
There are only a limited number of places available for this

42
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:15,000
so to make a booking phone 560341.

43
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:20,362
In addition, if you open an account you get lots more special offers

44
00:03:20,362 --> 00:03:24,900
including the chance to try out equipment at special open evenings....
